  "published": "2026-11-17T21:59:19.277Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- New: TcpServerChannel can be bound to a specific IP address via optional listenerIpAddress constructor parameter (previously always all interfaces).\n- Fixed: crash on Dispose after Close (#226); client disconnection after server close; server process termination when closing an inactive session threw; null deserialized SerializedDiffGram; leaks of SHA256, PrincipalContext/UserPrincipal; Hashtable BSON deserialization issues (now Dictionary).\n- Fixed: NeoBinary deserialization of cycles running through collections (#252): list items, array elements and dictionary values that refer to an object which is still being deserialized are now restored correctly instead of silently becoming null or throwing InvalidCastException/ArgumentException.\n- Improved: NeoBinarySerializer dispatch and deserialization performance.\n- Updated NuGet packages, incl. WatsonTcp 6.0.11 → 6.5.0 (~14x lower TCP round-trip latency on .NET Framework).\n- Security: Updated vulnerable transitive dependencies System.Formats.Asn1 (CVE-2024-38095) and System.Text.Json (CVE-2024-43485) to 10.0.14; removed redundant Cng/OpenSsl package references from the net8.0 target.",
